    "answer": {
      "short": "$\\frac{x+3}{x-5}$, $x\\ne1,5$.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x+3}{x-1}\\times\\frac{x-1}{x-5}&=\\frac{(x+3)(x-1)}{(x-1)(x-5)}\\\\\\frac{x+3}{x-1}\\times\\frac{x-1}{x-5}&=\\frac{x+3}{x-5}\\end{align*}$$\nOriginal domain: $x\\ne1,5$.",
